, opening hours are 08:30-21:30, the last combo tickets are sold at 19:00, and the last standard tickets are sold at 2","","","","r","Great tower with drums to toll the time to the old city. Short musical performances every hour or so."],["General Yang Hucheng's Zhiyuan Villa","sight",34.2731,108.93513,"117 Qingnian Road, Lianhu District (莲湖区青年路117号)","09:00-17:00, closed on Mondays","","","","r","One of two heritage properties administered by the Xi'an Incident Museum (西安事变纪念馆). the other being General Zhang Xueliang's Official Residence (listed below). Generals Yang Hucheng and Zhang Xueliang were the leading conspirators…"],["Great Mosque","sight",34.2634,108.93661,"30 Huajue Alley, Lianhu District (莲湖区化觉巷30号)","08:00-18:40","","","","r","Uniquely built in a traditional Chinese architectural style during the Ming Dynasty, with room for 1,000 worshipers. Built by the Muslim community who is settling in China for the Silk Trade. It is still an active place of worship for…"],["Guangren Temple","sight",34.27612,108.92127,"152 Xibei First Road, Lianhu District (莲湖区西北一路152号)","08:00-18:00","","","","r","Established by the Kangxi Emperor in 1705. The temple is noteworthy for being the only Tibetan Buddhist temple in Shaanxi Province."],["Daxuexi Alley Mosque","sight",34.26372,108.93111,"","08:00-19:00","","","","r","The temple was founded in 705 AD, it is one of the oldest mosques in Xi'an."],["Wen Xin Jiaozi Guan","restaurant",34.2693,108.93556,"123 Xushimiao Street","","","","","r","A good cheap place for jiaozi (Chinese dumplings). There is no menu, but endless supplies of fresh jiaozi of many flavors."]]}